			<tr><td><a href="img/amazon016.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/amazon016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/amazon/img/amazon016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/amazon017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/amazon017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/amazon/img/amazon017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/amazon018.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/amazon018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/tta/amazon/img/amazon018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">鮮やかなインコは高さのあるスタイル。<br />
				飾るにはカプセルが必須。</td></tr>
